# Pachelbel, Canon in D. Public domain.
#
# The eight-bar ground bass as written, chord figuration above it, and the
# first violin's entry in whole notes. Later divisions are not transcribed.
# D major, 64 BPM, 24 bars, 4/4. Three sections: ground, entry, second.

